{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Fighting the Competition"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Follow-Up"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > How Old is Old"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le09ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions, Plans, and Intentions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When we know about the future, the <span class=\"strong\">Present Tense</span> is used:<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span> is used for things that are arranged and scheduled:</li><span class=\"italic\">We have a meeting next Monday. </span><br/><span class=\"italic\">We need to send this by the end of next week. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous </span>is used for plans or arrangements: </li> \t<span class=\"italic\">We are working on getting it done. </span><br /> \t<span class=\"italic\">I'm meeting her at 4 pm today. </span><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When we don't know much about the future, \u201c<span class=\"italic\">Will\u201d </span> is used:  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li><span class=\"italic\">\u201cWill\u201d</span> is used to make predictions:</li> <span class=\"italic\">We will finish the project by the end of the week. </span>  <br /> \t<span class=\"italic\">I think you will enjoy the new strategy. </span><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li><span class=\"italic\"> \u201cWill\u201d </span>  is also used to mean <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cwant to\u201d </span>  or <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cbe willing to\u201d </span>:</li> \t<span class=\"italic\">I hope you will finish the proposal soon. </span><span class=\"italic\"><br/>Janet said Peter will help you. </span><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li><span class=\"italic\">\u201cWill\u201d </span>is used to make offers and promises: </li> \t<span class=\"italic\">I will see you tomorrow after the meeting. </span>  <br /> \t<span class=\"italic\">She will send you an email with the details. </span>  <br /> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li>To talk about offers and promises we can also use <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cwill\u201d: </span> </li>  \t<span class=\"italic\">Janet will be at the meeting tomorrow. </span>  <br /> \t<span class=\"italic\">Peter will help with the proposal. </span>  <br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> \t<li><span class=\"italic\"> \u201c(be) going to\u201d </span> is used to talk about plans and intentions: <span/> </li><span class=\"italic\">I'm going to work on the proposal. </span>  <br />"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "format "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way in which something is organized or arranged"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could perhaps change the format of the proposal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when in a meeting. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to give somebody a hand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to help someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter can give you a hand with this. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to submit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give a piece of writing to someone for them to consider or approve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have to submit it by the end of the week.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "objectives"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you are trying to achieve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've set our objectives for this campaign.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "integrated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "combines many different ideas in a way that works well"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We must develop an integrated plan."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "campaign"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a series of actions intended to achieve a particular result"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our campaign should enable them to save money. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "time-consuming"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "taking a long time to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to find a way that is less time-consuming."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "competitor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a company that is trying to be better than another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It looks we have a competitor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob01aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Language For Making Recommendations "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the Business world, at times, you have an idea, a recommendation or plan that you think could work for your company."}, {"type": "text", "content": " It is important to use proper language to offer those ideas for someone to consider. Here is some language you can use for making and responding to recommendations:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Making Recommendations</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Responding to Recommendations</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You could \u2026 *</span> <br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">You might want to \u2026 *</span><br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I were you, I'd \u2026*</span><br />  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's generally best/a good idea to \u2026 *</span><br/>  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">One idea is to \u2026*</span> <br />  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I suggest \u2026 *</span><br /> <br /> * These expressions are followed by a bare infinitive (verb without \u2018to') <br /> <br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">In my experience, \u2026 **</span><br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Works really well.</span><br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have you tried \u2026 ? **</span><br /> <br /> ** These expressions are followed by a noun or -ing form. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's not a bad idea. </span> <br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I agree. </span> <br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I like the sound of that. </span> <br />  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's a good idea. </span> <br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">This sounds great. </span> <br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "In my experience, changing the format should work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You could perhaps change the format."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You might want to have someone work with you on this."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I were you, I would work hard to have the proposal done. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Take a look at a recent project you have completed at work. Is there anything you would change about it? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think of three recommendations on how to make sure the next project works smoothly."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present these recommendations to a partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Be sure to use \u201cwill\u201d when talking about future plans and actions. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I review a project and make recommendations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my recommendations to a partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use \u201cwill\u201d when discussing future plans and actions."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary and Grammar"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about jobs and work. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make and respond to recommendations. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about future actions, plans and intentions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How do you organize your time when you are working on a project?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you plan out all the things you have to do? Why or why not?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "gr