n6le09ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le09ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hi, Janet. What's the rush? I just got your message. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I have just received a voicemail from Farmani. He was asking about the proposal. I told him we are working on it. But we need to send this in ASAP. The deadline is fast approaching. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I agree. I'm working on the last details, but we're going to need to pick a strategy to focus on. Then, I'll be able to finish it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You could perhaps change the format. That way it'll be done sooner than later. You might want to have Peter give you a hand with this."}, {"time": "29000", "image": "engenn6le09ob01re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That's not a bad idea. I'm meeting him at 2 p.m. Then, we'll work together so we can submit it by the end of the week. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: If I were you, I would try to have this proposal done by Tuesday."}, {"time": "38900", "image": "engenn6le09ob01re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Tuesday? That's impossible. I can't meet this deadline. I've set our goals and objectives. I'm also planning PR together with advertising and social media to help us develop an integrated campaign that is less time consuming and will save them money. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: These all sound great. Oh and before I forget, it looks like we have a competitor."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}